  "description": "WTC : Recruitment Day is a very short side-story comedy/drama interactive visual novel, based on the main \"Welcome To... Chichester\" series, and set in a semi-fictional world of secret organisations. \n\nIt is self-contained, and so reading other episodes is not a requirement to enjoy this game.\n\nAfter Grendel Jinx is mugged, she chases after the thief, determined to retrieve her possessions - and also recruit the person responsible. For once, Grendel's lack of attention to security protocols at \"The Council Of The Unseen\" may have prevented further problems. \n\n• Grendel Jinx is voiced by \"Sarah\" \n\n• Two different endings \n\n• Short, two-chapter story (approx. around 30 minutes to complete) \n\n• The 'Self-Expanding Frying Pan' is back! \n\n• Spanish translation by Daynel Chavez (@imqu4d)\n\n• Japanese translation by Translator GORO=chan (@gorochantransl1)\n\n• French translation by Oswinclankk (Tawaci™️ Media)\n\n \n\nRating: Off-screen violence. Some adult dialogue \n\nGrendel Jinx and her mother. \n\nLorinda Ella and The Boss",
